        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Enables the transfer of a long-chain fatty acid from one side of a membrane to the other. A long-chain fatty acid has an aliphatic tail containing 13 to 22 carbons.</obo:IAO_0000115>
