            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The array of microtubules and associated molecules that forms between opposite poles of a eukaryotic cell during mitosis or meiosis and serves to move the duplicated chromosomes apart.</obo:IAO_0000115>
