        <owl:annotatedTarget>Binding to a cytokine, any of a group of proteins that function to control the survival, growth and differentiation of tissues and cells, and which have autocrine and paracrine activity.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>GOC:ai</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>GOC:bf</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
