        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which relatively unspecialized cells acquire specialized structural and/or functional features that characterize the cells of the spinal cord. Differentiation includes the processes involved in commitment of a cell to a specific fate.</obo:IAO_0000115>
