        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which coenzyme A is transported across a membrane. Coenzyme A, 3&apos;-phosphoadenosine-(5&apos;)diphospho(4&apos;)pantatheine, is an acyl carrier in many acylation and acyl-transfer reactions in which the intermediate is a thiol ester.</obo:IAO_0000115>
