        <oboInOwl:id>GO:0035775</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>This term is intended for annotation of fish and other organisms which contain a glomerulus as part of the pronephric nephron. It should not be used for annotation of Xenopus, which contains a pronephric glomus rather than a glomerulus.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>pronephric glomerulus morphogenesis</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
