        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The progression of the glomerulus of the pronephric kidney over time from its initial formation until its mature state. The pronephric glomerulus is part of the pronephric nephron and is restricted to one body segment.</obo:IAO_0000115>
