        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Development of a photoreceptor, a sensory cell in the eye that reacts to the presence of light. They usually contain a pigment that undergoes a chemical change when light is absorbed, thus stimulating a nerve.</obo:IAO_0000115>
