        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0016020"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any of the small (10-200 nm), heterogeneous, highly dynamic, sterol- and sphingolipid-enriched membrane domains that compartmentalize cellular processes. Small rafts can sometimes be stabilized to form larger platforms through protein-protein and protein-lipid interactions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
