            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The cellular and vascular changes occurring in the endometrium of the pregnant uterus just after the onset of blastocyst implantation. This process involves the proliferation and differentiation of the fibroblast-like endometrial stromal cells into large, polyploid decidual cells that eventually form the maternal component of the placenta.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Wikipedia:Decidualization</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
