        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0036094"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Binding to a monosaccharide. Monosaccharides are the simplest carbohydrates; they are polyhydroxy aldehydes H[CH(OH)]nC(=O)H or polyhydroxy ketones H[CHOH]nC(=O)[CHOH]mH with three or more carbon atoms. They form the constitutional repeating units of oligo- and polysaccharides.</obo:IAO_0000115>
