            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the myoblast over time, from its formation to the mature structure. A myoblast is a mononucleate cell type that, by fusion with other myoblasts, gives rise to the myotubes that eventually develop into skeletal muscle fibers.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>GO:0048627</oboInOwl:id>
