            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A developmental process, independent of morphogenetic (shape) change, that is required for an animal organ to attain its fully functional state. An organ is a tissue or set of tissues that work together to perform a specific function or functions.</obo:IAO_0000115>
