        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0050790"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that modulates the frequency, rate or extent of hydrolase activity, the catalysis of the hydrolysis of various bonds, e.g. C-O, C-N, C-C, phosphoric anhydride bonds, etc. Hydrolase is the systematic name for any enzyme of EC class 3.</obo:IAO_0000115>
