        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0042391"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The process in which membrane potential decreases with respect to its steady-state potential, usually from negative potential to a more positive potential. For example, the initial depolarization during the rising phase of an action potential is in the direction from the negative steady-state resting potential towards the positive membrane potential that will be the peak of the action potential.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Reactome:R-HSA-112308</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>biological_process</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
